ji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m015-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003215","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji052-001","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003214","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p003215","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p001","quote":"齊悼惠王劉肥者，高祖長庶男也。其母外婦也，曰曹氏。高祖六年，立肥為齊王，食七十城，諸民能齊言者皆予齊王。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"高祖長庶男","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示子、生、母、兄弟姊及婚姻分型，繼位不補未記血親；校勘名、母家與未名家屬不擅定姓名，案件敘事不冒稱獨立核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji052-002","person_id":"cbr-p003215","surfaces":["高帝","高皇帝","高祖"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p001","quote":"齊悼惠王劉肥者，高祖長庶男也。其母外婦也，曰曹氏。高祖六年，立肥為齊王，食七十城，諸民能齊言者皆予齊王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p011","quote":"瑯邪王劉澤既見欺，不得反國，乃說齊王曰：「齊悼惠王高皇帝長子，推本言之，而大王高皇帝適長孫也，當立。今諸大臣狐疑未有所定，而澤於劉氏最為長年，大臣固待澤決計。今大王留臣無為也，不如使我入關計事。」齊王以為然，乃益具車送瑯邪王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","quote":"瑯邪王既行，齊遂舉兵西攻呂國之濟南。於是齊哀王遺諸侯王書曰：「高帝平定天下，王諸子弟，悼惠王於齊。悼惠王薨，惠帝使留侯張良立臣為齊王。惠帝崩，高后用事，春秋高，聽諸呂擅廢高帝所立，又殺三趙王，滅梁、燕、趙以王諸呂，分齊國為四。忠臣進諫，上惑亂不聽。今高后崩，皇帝春秋富，未能治天下，固恃大臣諸（將）［侯］。今諸呂又擅自尊官，聚兵嚴威，劫列侯忠臣，矯制以令天下，宗廟所以危。今寡人率兵入誅不當為王者。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p015","quote":"大臣議欲立齊王，而瑯邪王及大臣曰：「齊王母家駟鈞，惡戾，虎而冠者也。方以呂氏故幾亂天下，今又立齊王，是欲復為呂氏也。代王母家薄氏，君子長者；且代王又親高帝子，於今見在，且最為長。以子則順，以善人則大臣安。」於是大臣乃謀迎立代王，而遣朱虛侯以誅呂氏事告齊王，令罷兵。"}],"rationale":"依明示名與王國、世次的局部敘事暫接；齊、城陽與菑川同諡者分開，興居與志分開。校勘建延及內史勳士未擅選讀法，未名帝后不補姓名，案件只保存來源敘事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p001","text":"齊悼惠王劉肥者，高祖長庶男也。其母外婦也，曰曹氏。高祖六年，立肥為齊王，食七十城，諸民能齊言者皆予齊王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0000","start":0,"end":6,"surface":"齊悼惠王劉肥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003215","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"曹氏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003237","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003215","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"肥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m001-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p011","text":"瑯邪王劉澤既見欺，不得反國，乃說齊王曰：「齊悼惠王高皇帝長子，推本言之，而大王高皇帝適長孫也，當立。今諸大臣狐疑未有所定，而澤於劉氏最為長年，大臣固待澤決計。今大王留臣無為也，不如使我入關計事。」齊王以為然，乃益具車送瑯邪王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m011-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"瑯邪王劉澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003225","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003220","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m011-0021","start":21,"end":25,"surface":"齊悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"co